  "description": "Free, MIT-licensed in-process message bus for .NET with pub/sub consumers, Polly-backed retry, and transactional-outbox-friendly delivery. A focused alternative to MassTransit for modular monoliths that want reliable messaging without adopting a paid distributed messaging framework or a heavyweight broker dependency.",
