  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Add in-process request/response messaging via IRequestClient<TRequest, TResponse> and IRequestHandler<TRequest, TResponse> with correlated replies, configurable timeout handling, and retry-backed handler execution. 1.0.1: Add missing package icon. 1.0.0: Initial release. IConsumer<T>, IMessageBus (Publish/Send), in-memory transport, Polly retry, DI registration.",
